{"id":"A1-L043","title":"Can / can’t: practice and contrast","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U03","focus":"Can / can’t — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Can / can’t — prática e contraste","pron":"do you (fala rápida)","verbs":["clean"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["myth","step","practice","without","repeat","hear","learn","method","fluency","vocabulary","pronunciation","learner","confidence","lesson"],"field":"Alimentação","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Fala","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 43 · Can / can’t: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Can / can’t — prática e contraste.","**Verbos:** clean.","**Pronúncia:** do you (fala rápida).","**8 palavras novas** (alimentação).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo contrastar can e can’t e dar minha opinião sobre habilidades."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["myth","mito"],["step","passo"],["practice","praticar"],["without","sem"],["repeat","repetir"],["hear","ouvir"],["learn","aprender"],["method","method"],["fluency","fluency"],["vocabulary","vocabulary"],["pronunciation","pronunciation"],["learner","learner"],["confidence","confidence"],["lesson","lesson"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Everyone Can Learn","paras":["Some people say, “I **can’t** learn languages.” That is a myth. Everyone **can** learn if they practice.","You **can** start small: **clean** your desk, study ten minutes, and **repeat**. You **can’t** learn without time, but you **can** learn in small steps.","So **can** you do it? Yes, you can!"],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Learning Today","gloss":[["myth","mito"],["step","passo"],["practice","praticar"],["without","sem"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Everyone can learn if they practice.","ans":"T","why":"Primeira frase."},{"q":"You can learn without time.","ans":"F","why":"“can’t learn without time.”"},{"q":"You can start small.","ans":"T","why":"“start small.”"},{"q":"The writer is a teacher.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“myth” means…","opts":["mito","verdade","regra"],"ans":0,"why":"myth = mito."},{"q":"“step” means…","opts":["passo","degrau","parada"],"ans":0,"why":"step = passo."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Can / can’t: practice","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["capacidade","**She can speak three languages.**"],["permissão","**You can sit here.**"],["pedido","**Can you help me?**"],["impossibilidade","**I can’t hear you.**"]],"cap":"Usos de can"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Could?","body":"**Can** é informal; **could** é mais educado: *Could you help me?*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"You ___ learn if you practice. (can)","a":"can","why":"capacidade."},{"s":"I ___ hear you. (can’t)","a":"can’t","why":"negativa."},{"s":"___ you help me?","a":"Can","why":"pedido."},{"s":"She ___ speak three languages. (can)","a":"can","why":"capacidade."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["myth","mito"],["step","passo"],["practice","praticar"],["without","sem"],["repeat","repetir"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["I","can","Yes"],"ans":"Yes I can","pt":"Sim."},{"words":["can","Sure","I"],"ans":"Sure I can","pt":"Claro."}]}]}